{"id":"n60093-1-12","stage":1,"title":"결과 · 结果","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n60093-1-12-1","ko":"시험 결과가 내일 나오는데 너무 떨려.","zh":"明天出考试结果，我好紧张。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"시험","meaning":"考试","explanation":"시험：考试","readings":[{"term":"시험","audio":"/audio/ff65dc582ce71198934b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20233","senseId":"1","lemma":"시험","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"결과가","meaning":"结果，结局","explanation":"결과：结果，结局；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"결과","audio":"/audio/109383e344db8ae54a47.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60093","senseId":"1","lemma":"결과","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"내일","meaning":"明天，明日","explanation":"내일：明天，明日","readings":[{"term":"내일","audio":"/audio/1e07b94ba5182a41e7de.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30193","senseId":"1","lemma":"내일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나오는데","meaning":"出，出来","explanation":"나오다：出，出来；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"나오다","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62233","senseId":"16","lemma":"나오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"떨려.","meaning":"发抖，颤动","explanation":"떨리다：发抖，颤动；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"떨리다","audio":"/audio/cc04aaccec373561a186.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69293","senseId":"1","lemma":"떨리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ff65dc582ce71198","term":"시험","zh":"考试","audio":"/audio/ff65dc582ce71198934b.mp3","entryId":"20233","definition":"按照问题、提问、实际行动等一定程序考核考生的知识或能力的事宜。","pronunciation":["시험"]},{"id":"109383e344db8ae5","term":"결과","zh":"结果，结局","audio":"/audio/109383e344db8ae54a47.mp3","entryId":"60093","definition":"某件事情或过程结束后的状态或现象。","pronunciation":["결과"]},{"id":"1e07b94ba5182a41","term":"내일","zh":"明天，明日","audio":"/audio/1e07b94ba5182a41e7de.mp3","entryId":"30193","definition":"今天的下一天。","pronunciation":["내일"]},{"id":"038a8038eb817ffe","term":"나오다","zh":"出，出来","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3","entryId":"62233","definition":"完成某种处理后产生结果。","pronunciation":["나오다"]},{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"cc04aaccec373561","term":"떨리다","zh":"发抖，颤动","audio":"/audio/cc04aaccec373561a186.mp3","entryId":"69293","definition":"身体或身体的一部分反复快速地抖动。","pronunciation":["떨리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/4ab91ee14b1610eaa638.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n60093-1-12-2","ko":"최선을 다했으니까 좋은 결과가 있을 거야.","zh":"你已经尽力了，会有好结果的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"최선을","meaning":"全力，尽力，全力以赴","explanation":"최선：全力，尽力，全力以赴；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"최선","audio":"/audio/2fb1ce43c84887529f70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72132","senseId":"2","lemma":"최선","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다했으니까","meaning":"竭尽，尽到","explanation":"다하다：竭尽，尽到；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；으니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"다하다","audio":"/audio/238dc042d00a64bf08fc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61526","senseId":"4","lemma":"다하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋은","meaning":"好，美，优良，优美","explanation":"좋다：好，美，优良，优美；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"1","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"결과가","meaning":"结果，结局","explanation":"결과：结果，结局；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"결과","audio":"/audio/109383e344db8ae54a47.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60093","senseId":"1","lemma":"결과","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있을","meaning":"可能","explanation":"있다：可能；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"6","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거야.","meaning":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的推测或信念等。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"5","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"2fb1ce43c8488752","term":"최선","zh":"全力，尽力，全力以赴","audio":"/audio/2fb1ce43c84887529f70.mp3","entryId":"72132","definition":"全部的精力与力量。","pronunciation":["최ː선","췌ː선"]},{"id":"238dc042d00a64bf","term":"다하다","zh":"竭尽，尽到","audio":"/audio/238dc042d00a64bf08fc.mp3","entryId":"61526","definition":"为做某事而用上了全心全力。","pronunciation":["다ː하다"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，美，优良，优美","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"性质或内容等很优秀，让人满意。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"109383e344db8ae5","term":"결과","zh":"结果，结局","audio":"/audio/109383e344db8ae54a47.mp3","entryId":"60093","definition":"某件事情或过程结束后的状态或现象。","pronunciation":["결과"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"可能","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"存在发生某种状况的可能性或实为如此。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/cd52098c0563291487fd.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.817,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=60093","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":48,"sequenceScore":2.1087,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["你已经尽力了，会有好结果的。","明天出考试结果，我好紧张。","智秀的梦想是当飞行员？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["明天出考试结果，我好紧张。","智秀的梦想是当飞行员？","你已经尽力了，会有好结果的。"],"answer":2}]}
